# Workflow plan step W5 (docs/WORKFLOW_PLAN.md, 2026-11-14): an OpenFOAM case's Results page. pitzDaily meshed from the steps
# bar, given the walls' y+ and the inlet's and outlet's flow rates as function objects, and run 50 iterations (short of
# converging): Results says it ran its iterations without converging, how far the residuals fell, the flow rates with
# whether they have settled, the walls' y+ and the mass balance; the bar's sixth step is Results; "Is the mesh fine enough?"
# opens the New study dialog with the mesh refinement chosen.
open $SB/ws/pitzDaily
wait 10
click wf-next
wait-until job finished timeout 60
wait 10
shell foamDictionary system/controlDict -entry endTime -set 50 > /dev/null && foamDictionary system/controlDict -entry writeInterval -set 25 > /dev/null
shell foamDictionary system/controlDict -entry functions -set '{ yPlus { type yPlus; libs (fieldFunctionObjects); writeControl writeTime; } inFlow { type surfaceFieldValue; libs (fieldFunctionObjects); regionType patch; name inlet; operation sum; fields (phi); writeFields false; writeControl timeStep; } outFlow { type surfaceFieldValue; libs (fieldFunctionObjects); regionType patch; name outlet; operation sum; fields (phi); writeFields false; writeControl timeStep; } }' > /dev/null
wait 120
click nav:results
wait-until page Results
assert text No results yet
click nav:run
wait-until page Run
click run-go
wait-until job finished timeout 180
wait 60
click nav:results
wait-until page Results
wait 30
assert text Ran all 50 iterations without converging
assert text The residuals never met their targets
assert text inFlow
assert text Flow rate (out is +)
assert text Walls: y+
assert text Mass balance
assert text Not converged: check them
assert text Run longer
screenshot $OUT/results.png
wheel -8
wait 10
screenshot $OUT/results2.png
click res-meshstudy
wait-until modal study-new timeout 5
assert text Mesh refinement
assert text mesh independence
screenshot $OUT/meshstudy.png
key ESCAPE
wait 5
